text:
If you want to have Opus 4.5 at it's MAX in Claude Code

Update ~/.claude/settings.json 
{
  "env": {
    "CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS": "64000",
    "MAX_THINKING_TOKENS": "31999"
  }
}

- double the output
- ultrathink always on

Ctrl+O will show thinking in verbose mode

@BenjaminDEKR 👋 this happens if your context window fills up really fast. To debug:

1. Run /context to make sure it looks healthy
2. If that doesn’t show anything obvious, run /bug and dm me the bug id
